message: "Если вы используете этот код или результаты, сошлитесь на них по данным ниже. If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproducible comparison of hourly cryptocurrency return forecasting models with news sentiment: code, protocol and results"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dovgopolik
    given-names: Varvara Sergeevna
    affiliation: Saint Petersburg State University
  - family-names: Podkorytova
    given-names: Olga Anatolyevna
    affiliation: Saint Petersburg State University
abstract: >-
  Code, experiment protocol (fixed before the computations, with a log of later deviations) and
  results for comparing hourly BTCUSDT and ETHUSDT return forecasts on Binance (zero forecast,
  historical mean, ARIMA, ARIMAX, Random Forest, XGBoost, LSTM) with and without English-language
  (CryptoVision) and Russian-language (ForkLog) news sentiment features. Includes expanding-window
  walk-forward evaluation, Diebold–Mariano and Pesaran–Timmermann tests with the Holm correction,
  the Model Confidence Set, a trading evaluation with transaction costs, leakage checks and a
  pre-specified model selection criterion.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - bitcoin
  - ether
  - return forecasting
  - news sentiment
  - reproducibility
  - walk-forward validation
  - transaction costs
